UI 2.0: Sora, Lucide, blurred panels and adaptive layouts. Tap camera values for details; hold or drag for compact dials. Gimbal Mode, Speed and Ramp have tabs. Portrait Fit centers the picture below independent top readouts. Motion Control is lighter and its editor leaves the joystick usable. The larger zoom dial reaches the screen edge. This build also hardens stability: photo sharing, Bluetooth drops and face auto-focus recover instead of closing the app. Motion Control remains experimental.